  (text "POWER: VBUS > F1 > FB1 > +5V | U3 buck +3V3 | U4 LDO +1V2 | U5 LDO +3.3VA (always on) | U6 +/-2.5V gated by ANA_EN (FPGA) | est. 1.3 W"
    (at 30.48 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "36881f4b-2f16-4e91-9d9c-d9dfd777dfb7")
  )
  (text "1. Datasheet-verified 2026-10-02: LTC2290, FT232H, iCE40 HW checklist, TPS62162, THS4521, OPA356, LP5907, TLV755P, LM27762 (see DESIGN_NOTES.md)."
    (at 279.4 69.85 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5fa404fc-9db9-4b51-b638-efbf00bec1fb")
  )
  (text "4. +3.3VA stays on (LTC2290 inputs must not exceed VDD+0.3V). Before USB config: ANA_EN low (op-amp rails off), ADC_SHDN high (ADC nap ~30mW)."
    (at 279.4 85.09 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "31526c58-cfd5-4ead-81b1-9a833080b52c")
  )
